2026-09-10 10:28:03.301 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR] Versionshinweise:
2026-09-10 10:28:03.337 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]   1. Heap overflow vulnerability is fixed in RAR5 recovery volume
2026-09-10 10:28:03.368 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        data reconstruction code. It affects WinRAR, RAR and UnRAR.
2026-09-10 10:28:03.411 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        UnRAR.dll library doesn't include recovery volume processing,
2026-09-10 10:28:03.444 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        so it is not affected.
2026-09-10 10:28:03.481 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]   
2026-09-10 10:28:03.517 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        We are thankful to Arjun Basnet from Securin Labs for letting us know
2026-09-10 10:28:03.548 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        about this security issue.
2026-09-10 10:28:03.591 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]   
2026-09-10 10:28:03.628 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]     2. Symbolic link pointing outside of destination folder could be created
2026-09-10 10:28:03.662 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        even without -ola switch, when extracting a specially crafted
2026-09-10 10:28:03.696 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        RAR archive by WinRAR, RAR, UnRAR or UnRAR.dll library.
2026-09-10 10:28:03.727 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]   
2026-09-10 10:28:03.761 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        Further check in extraction code prevents placing files to such folder
2026-09-10 10:28:03.796 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        even in case of multiple extraction commands, excluding the possibility
2026-09-10 10:28:03.825 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        of path traversal attack for WinRAR, RAR or UnRAR based extraction.
2026-09-10 10:28:03.853 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        It limits the potential threat to a case where another tool uses this
2026-09-10 10:28:03.879 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        symbolic link to store files.
2026-09-10 10:28:03.894 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]   
2026-09-10 10:28:03.919 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        We are thankful to scofaild23-bnomran for letting us know about this
2026-09-10 10:28:03.952 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        security issue.
2026-09-10 10:28:03.980 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]   
2026-09-10 10:28:04.009 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]     3. 7zxa.dll 7z extraction library is updated to version 26.02 to include
2026-09-10 10:28:04.043 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]        bug and vulnerability fixes by the library developer.
2026-09-10 10:28:04.072 [INFO] [Standard/RARLab.WinRAR]   
