2026-09-10 10:28:07.005 [INFO] [Standard/RaspberryPiFoundation.RaspberryPiImager]   - Fastboot:
2026-09-10 10:28:07.041 [INFO] [Standard/RaspberryPiFoundation.RaspberryPiImager]     - Enumerate storage devices
