2026-09-10 10:28:07.232 [INFO] [Standard/RaspberryPiFoundation.RaspberryPiImager]     - Don't set any groups, leave it to the OS
2026-09-10 10:28:07.267 [INFO] [Standard/RaspberryPiFoundation.RaspberryPiImager]     - Use explicit runcmds for passwordless sudo
